#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "CSPLIT"
msgstr "CSPLIT"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux
#, no-wrap
msgid "August 2024"
msgstr "август 2024 г."

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "GNU coreutils 9.5"
msgstr "GNU coreutils 9.5"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Commands"
msgstr "Команды пользователя"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "НАИМЕНОВАНИЕ"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "csplit - split a file into sections determined by context lines"
msgstr "csplit — разбить файл на части, определяемые контекстными строками"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "ОБЗОР"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<csplit> [I<\\,OPTION\\/>]... I<\\,FILE PATTERN\\/>..."
msgstr "B<csplit> [I<\\,ПАРАМЕТР\\/>]... I<\\,ФАЙЛ ШАБЛОН\\/>..."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "ОПИСАНИЕ"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Output pieces of FILE separated by PATTERN(s) to files 'xx00', 'xx01', ..., "
"and output byte counts of each piece to standard output."
msgstr ""
"Вывести части ФАЙЛа, разделённые ШАБЛОНом (ШАБЛОНами), в файлы «xx00», "
"«xx01», ..., и вывести размер в байтах каждой части в стандартный поток "
"вывода."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Read standard input if FILE is -"
msgstr "Читать из стандартного потока ввода, если ФАЙЛ задан как -."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Mandatory arguments to long options are mandatory for short options too."
msgstr ""
"Обязательные аргументы для длинных опций обязательны и для коротких опций."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-b>, B<--suffix-format>=I<\\,FORMAT\\/>"
msgstr "B<-b>, B<--suffix-format>=I<\\,ФОРМАТ\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "use sprintf FORMAT instead of %02d"
msgstr "использовать sprintf-совместимый ФОРМАТ суффикса вместо %02d"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-f>, B<--prefix>=I<\\,PREFIX\\/>"
msgstr "B<-f>, B<--prefix>=I<\\,ПРЕФИКС\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "use PREFIX instead of 'xx'"
msgstr "использовать ПРЕФИКС вместо «xx»"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-k>, B<--keep-files>"
msgstr "B<-k>, B<--keep-files>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "do not remove output files on errors"
msgstr "не удалять выходные файлы в случае возникновения ошибок"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--suppress-matched>"
msgstr "B<--suppress-matched>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "suppress the lines matching PATTERN"
msgstr "не выводить строки, соответствующие ШАБЛОНу"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-n>, B<--digits>=I<\\,DIGITS\\/>"
msgstr "B<-n>, B<--digits>=I<\\,ЦИФРЫ\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "use specified number of digits instead of 2"
msgstr "использовать указанное количество цифр вместо 2"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-s>, B<--quiet>, B<--silent>"
msgstr "B<-s>, B<--quiet>, B<--silent>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "do not print counts of output file sizes"
msgstr "не выводить размеры выходных файлов"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-z>, B<--elide-empty-files>"
msgstr "B<-z>, B<--elide-empty-files>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "suppress empty output files"
msgstr "не создавать пустые выходные файлы"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--help>"
msgstr "B<--help>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "display this help and exit"
msgstr "отобразить эту справочную информацию и завершить работу"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--version>"
msgstr "B<--version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output version information and exit"
msgstr "вывести информацию о версии и завершить работу"

#. type: SS
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each PATTERN may be:"
msgstr "Каждый ШАБЛОН может представлять собой:"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "INTEGER"
msgstr "ЦЕЛОЕ"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "copy up to but not including specified line number"
msgstr "копировать до строки с указанным номером, не включая её"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "/REGEXP/[OFFSET]"
msgstr "/РЕГУЛЯРНОЕ_ВЫРАЖЕНИЕ/[СМЕЩЕНИЕ]"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "copy up to but not including a matching line"
msgstr "копировать до совпадающей строки, не включая её"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%REGEXP%[OFFSET]"
msgstr "%РЕГУЛЯРНОЕ_ВЫРАЖЕНИЕ%[СМЕЩЕНИЕ]"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "skip to, but not including a matching line"
msgstr "пропустить содержимое до совпадающей строки, не включая её"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "{INTEGER}"
msgstr "{ЦЕЛОЕ}"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "repeat the previous pattern specified number of times"
msgstr "повторить предыдущий шаблон указанное количество раз"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "{*}"
msgstr "{*}"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "repeat the previous pattern as many times as possible"
msgstr "повторять предыдущий шаблон до тех пор, пока это возможно"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "A line OFFSET is an integer optionally preceded by '+' or '-'"
msgstr ""
"СМЕЩЕНИЕ строки — это целое число, которому может предшествовать «+» или «-»."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "AUTHOR"
